data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":76,"item_id":"msg_070f5ad73dd28ae4016acaba68d12487d2923fc3f0c1491f75","output_index":0,"content_index":0,"text":"Need schema membership mapping, migrations existing tasks preserving current order. Implement task_project_positions(task_id,project_id,position). On creation record. Move: if existing membership position then restore; else append and insert. Need avoid unique positions perhaps independent. Current task's position per project can store upon move. Migration seed current memberships. Make task moves transactional enough synchronous.","logprobs":[]}

